e  playing the vampire and also according  to rumor we have a world war hulk movie  coming this isn't confirmed yet and not  much is known but we assume that it is  going to follow the world war hulk  storyline where the illuminati some of  earth's heroes trick hulk into going  into outer space and to another planet  he ends up getting a wife and she gets  pregnant but she dies due to an  explosion of the ship that hulk was sent  there in and hulk is filled with rage  and comes back to earth and defeats  pretty much all of the heroes on earth  then he puts them in a stadium and makes  them all fight each other this is  definitely the type of hulk that fans  have been wanting to see since we saw  professor hulk in avengers end game we  also have another wakanda series coming  when ryan coogler signed on to direct a  disney plus wakanda project he actually  signed on for a multi-year deal so  expect another wakanda project coming at  some point in time now we can't forget  about loki season 2 because that is  coming although we do not have an  official release date for it but they  left us on a major cliffhanger last time  and last year on disney plus day they  announced a agatha harkness disney plush  show agatha house of heartness as the  official title so we could be getting a  agatha harkness origin story here or she  gets out of westview and wanda spells  somehow perhaps something happens in  multiverse of madness and perhaps we'll  see her in the film then of course we  have the fantastic four we do not know  when they are coming although kevin  feige the president of marvel studios  has said that it is in development right  now so hopefully we'll actually get the  movie within the next two to three years  then we have nova a project that i know  a lot of people are going to be really  excited about kevin feige himself teased  the development of a nova project at  marvel studios in early 2021 reports  then came out that the fantastic four  was iron a 2023 produc